Fixed. The test now passes.

**Root cause:** `src/clamp.ts` only applied the lower bound (`Math.max(min, value)`) and never clamped to `max`, so `clamp(12, 0, 10)` returned `12` instead of `10`.

**Fix:** Changed the return to `Math.min(max, Math.max(min, value))` — the standard clamp idiom.

Test result: `1 pass, 0 fail` (3 expect calls). No changes to `clamp.test.ts` or `package.json`.
